OL,3,GNEWSADevastation remains a month on
OL,4,Afrom heatwave fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast month, Kim Yeomans watched her
OL,7,Fdaughter Kerry's house burn down in
OL,8,FBirmingham, leaving nothing behind.
OL,10,F"She was just absolutely broken,
OL,11,Fdevastated. We had to hold her back.
OL,12,FShe was screaming, crying," Kim said.
OL,14,FWhile their two dogs escaped, the
OL,15,Ffamily had been on their way to a
OL,16,Fcaravan holiday in Skegness at the
OL,17,Ftime, meaning they could not rescue any
OL,18,Fof their belongings.
OL,20,FThey raced back and had to watch the
OL,21,Fhouse burn to the ground.
